*************Notes***************

* You may use LTspice help.

* Any question mark (?) should be replaced by a word or a numeric value.

* Use nmos_part1_i where i refers to the deliverable you
* are working on.

*---------------------------------*
* Part 1.1
.MODEL nmos_part1_1 NMOS [level=1 Vto=0.4 kp=183.67u]

* Part1.2
*
.MODEL nmos_part1_2 NMOS [level=1 Vto=0.4 kp=183.67u Lambda=0.1]
* Don't forget to change the model name to nmos_part1_2

*---------------------------------*

* Part 1.3
.MODEL nmos_part1_3 NMOS [level=2 Vto=0.4 kp=183.67u Lambda=0.1 VMAX=170e3]
#not accurate results
*---------------------------------*

* Part 1.6
#.MODEL nmos_part1_6 NMOS [level=1 Vto=0.4 kp=183.67u Lambda=0.1 CJ=1m CJSW=100p  ]
.MODEL nmos_part1_6 NMOS [LEVEL=1 VTO=0.4 KP=183.67u LAMBDA=0.1 CJ=1e-3 CJSW=1e-10 ]
*---------------------------------*


